{#-
  Verify an email address. Sent on registering, and again when somebody
  asks for another link or tries to log in unverified. Context:
    verify_url   the verification link
    ttl_minutes  how long the link lasts
    welcome      true on registering, which greets them first
    name         who to greet: their full name, or their username where
                 the account has none
    username     the account's username, which they log in with
    email        the address this is sent to, said back to them: many
                 people read several addresses in one mailbox
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}
{% block subject %}Verify your Quill email address{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}The link lasts {{ ttl_minutes }} minutes.{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{{ c.heading("Verify your *email address*") }}
{{ c.paragraph("Hi " ~ name ~ ",") }}
{% if welcome %}
{{ c.paragraph("Welcome to Quill! Please verify your email address to activate your account.") }}
{% else %}
{{ c.paragraph("Please verify your email address to activate your Quill account.") }}
{% endif %}
{% call c.paragraph() %}Your username is <strong>{{ username }}</strong>. You will need it to log in.{% endcall %}
{{ c.button("Verify your email", verify_url) }}
{{ c.small("This link expires in " ~ ttl_minutes ~ " minutes.") }}
{{ c.small("This email was sent to " ~ email ~ ".") }}
{% endblock %}
{% block reason %}You are receiving this because this address was used to create an account on Quill.{% endblock %}

{% block text %}
Hi {{ name }},

{% if welcome %}Welcome to Quill! Please verify your email address to activate your account.{% else %}Please verify your email address to activate your Quill account.{% endif %}

Your username is {{ username }}. You will need it to log in.

Verify your email: {{ verify_url }}

This link expires in {{ ttl_minutes }} minutes.

This email was sent to {{ email }}.
{% endblock %}
